.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dotman-doctor 1  "doctor "
.SH NAME
dotman\-doctor \- Check the environment and the repo for problems
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdotman doctor\fR [\fB\-\-online\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the environment and the repo for problems
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-online\fR
Also ask the remote with `git ls\-remote`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show verbose output
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress informational messages
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pager\fR
Disable pager output
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-root\fR
Allow running as root
